  I heard a rumor telling of a feature in Jerbilia (#605), a Lost City where 
dwells the Couatl.  The Lost City is reputed to contain the Hannibal's 
Grimoire.
  With the coming of the early winter season, I travelled to Abu Matariq.  
In my travels, I saw no monster.

  Thy humble servant,   Jolin


