GENERAL INTELLIGENCE REPORT

Kingdom of Babba Sissoko (#0):
  From Behemond:  In spring, Hope (#94) journeyed to Kerry.  Hope caught up 
with Behemond in Kerry.
  In early summer, Tlazolteotl (#88) rode her flying armies into Moongard.
  In late summer, Tlazolteotl flew into Trouthome.
  In late summer, Alain (#33) rode his flying armies into Donegal.
  From Helatia:  In fall, Alain rode his flying armies into Katmai.
  A host of savage warriors carried the banner of 
Lord Babba Sissoko Master orango (#0) into the Forest province of Katmai, 
ruled by Agesilao (#9).  Alain (#33)'s forces conquered Katmai without any 
major battles.

Kingdom of Uga-Buga Makumb (#1):
  In early winter, Teleko (#72) rode his flying armies over to Berga.
  A conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) invaded the province of Berga, a 
Desert area ruled by Lady of Beer Mbaba (#3).  Teleko (#72)'s forces 
encountered little resistance in Berga and Teleko there established our 
rule.


Kingdom of Mbaba (#3):
  In spring, a conquering horde owing their allegiance to 
Shaman Uga-Buga Makumb Stuffy doll (#1) invaded the province of Berga, a 
Desert area ruled by Lady of Beer Mbaba (#3).  Teleko (#72)'s forces 
encountered little resistance in Berga and Teleko there established our 
rule.

